<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>The Operational Intensity of Accelerators</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As mentioned in the main text, <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{\mathrm{peak}}=\frac{\text{Peak FLOPS}}{\text{Memory Bandwidth}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>peak</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>Peak FLOPS</mtext><mtext>Memory Bandwidth</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{\mathrm{peak}}=\frac{\text{Peak FLOPS}}{\text{Memory Bandwidth}}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Below we calculate the <math id="A1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{\mathrm{peak}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>peak</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{\mathrm{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math> for several modern GPUs.</p>
</div>
